    {
        "content": "<p>The time taken to compile the JacobiZariski file and its neighbours on the Mathlib import tree randomly seesaws around, because changes to mathlib which have positive or no effect on timings across mathlib in general, might randomly affect JacobiZariski and these other files in extreme ways. For example yesterday mathlib PR <a href=\"https://github.com/leanprover-community/mathlib4/pull/38618\">#38618</a> was merged which sped up mathlib by 176G instructions (a big deal -- it even made the RSS feed for speedy PRs <a class=\"message-link\" href=\"/#narrow/channel/116290-rss/topic/Significant.20commits.20to.20mathlib4/near/591981950\">#rss &gt; Significant commits to mathlib4 @ 💬</a> ) whilst slowing down JacobiZariski by 30G instructions. Nobody cares about this any more because they know that another random change might speed it up by 30G instructions next week. The file is completely unpredictable, and this is very unlike 99% of the files in mathlib.</p>\n<p>In early February some random change affected JacobiZariski and I thought \"right that's it, I'm going to get to the bottom of this\". Kernel typechecking of some random declaration in this file had just massively changed, and I wanted to know why. The <code>trace.profiler</code> cannot be used to see what's going on -- it just reports the time it takes to typecheck the declaration and gives no further information. The core people told me that it was essential to get a mathlib-free minimisation. So I downloaded the mathlib-minimiser and set it to work on the declaration. Over two months later the minimiser is still running, the minimised file is over 4000 lines long, there have been lots of changes to lean and mathlib, and now the problem has gone away. I was too slow.</p>\n<p>Here, folded, is an example of the behaviour of variants of the theorem <a href=\"https://leanprover-community.github.io/mathlib4_docs/find/?pattern=Algebra.Generators.CotangentSpace.compEquiv_symm_inr#doc\">docs#Algebra.Generators.CotangentSpace.compEquiv_symm_inr</a> from the JacobiZariski file. In the file I demonstrate how universe changes can either dramatically speed up, or dramatically slow down, the time that the kernel takes to typecheck the proof.</p>\n<div class=\"spoiler-block\"><div class=\"spoiler-header\">\n<p>200 lines of commutative algebra</p>\n</div><div class=\"spoiler-content\" aria-hidden=\"true\">\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Lean4\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"kn\">import</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Mathlib</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">RingTheory</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Kaehler</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">JacobiZariski</span>\n<span class=\"c\">/-</span><span class=\"cm\">!</span>\n\n<span class=\"cm\">This file compiles with mathlib version `5b5173e00fdf199c02b3939ae3159ac435eb6f62`, 30th</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">April, post the merge of Mathlib PR #36818. Let me stress that Mathlib PR #36818 is</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">not the problem; this is just one of many examples of weird behaviour in the ring theory</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">needed to develop modern algebraic geometry.</span>\n\n<span class=\"cm\">-/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">open</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">KaehlerDifferential</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Module</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">MvPolynomial</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">TensorProduct</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">namespace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Algebra</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">Generators</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">universe</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u₁</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u₂</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u₃</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">x₁</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\">/-</span><span class=\"cm\">!</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">The below attribute hack is in mathlib just before the declaration</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">of `CotangentSpace.compEquiv_symm_inr` in the file `Mathlib.RingTheory.Kaehler.JacobiZariski`</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">so we leave it in here.</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">-/</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">attribute</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"kn\">local</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kn\">instance</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"mi\">999999</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Zero</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toOfNat0</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">SemilinearMapClass</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">distribMulActionSemiHomClass</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">SemilinearEquivClass</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">instSemilinearMapClass</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">instAddZeroClassTensorProduct</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">AddZero</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toZero</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">section</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mathlib_master</span>\n<span class=\"c\">/-</span><span class=\"cm\">!</span>\n\n<span class=\"cm\">This section is what's (at the time of writing) on `master`.</span>\n\n<span class=\"cm\">-/</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u₁</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u₂</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">CommRing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">CommRing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Algebra</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u₃</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">CommRing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Algebra</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Algebra</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">IsScalarTower</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">ι</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w₁</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">w₂</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Generators</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ι</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Generators</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">σ</span><span class=\"o\">)</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\">/-</span><span class=\"cm\">!</span>\n\n<span class=\"cm\">Before #38618 was merged, the declaration `CotangentSpace.compEquiv_symm_inr` was taking</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">1.3M mHeartbeats to typecheck.</span>\n\n<span class=\"cm\">  [Kernel] [1378184.000000] ✅️ typechecking declarations [Algebra.Generators.CotangentSpace.compEquiv_symm_inr]</span>\n\n<span class=\"cm\">After #36818 it is almost 19x slower:</span>\n\n<span class=\"cm\">  [Kernel] [25780304.000000] ✅️ typechecking declarations [Algebra.Generators.CotangentSpace.compEquiv_symm_inr']</span>\n\n<span class=\"cm\">However, essentially all other declarations in mathlib are faster or unchanged. This is weird.</span>\n\n<span class=\"cm\">Let's see it on master now. Search for the line `[Elab.async] [25780538.000000] ✅️ Lean.addDecl ▶`,</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">that's the line explaining how long the kernel is taking to typecheck this proof.</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">-/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">set_option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trace</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">profiler</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">useHeartbeats</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">true</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">set_option</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">trace</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">profiler</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">true</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">in</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">lemma</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">CotangentSpace</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">compEquiv_symm_inr'</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">compEquiv</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Q</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">symm</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toLinearMap</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">∘ₗ</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">LinearMap</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inr</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Q</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toExtension</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">CotangentSpace</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">⊗</span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"o\">]</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toExtension</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">CotangentSpace</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">=</span>\n<span class=\"w\">        </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Extension</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">CotangentSpace</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Q</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toComp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">toExtensionHom</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">liftBaseChange</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"k\">by</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">classical</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cotangentSpaceBasis</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">baseChange</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">ext</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">intro</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">i</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">apply</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">Q</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">comp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">P</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">cotangentSpaceBasis</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">repr</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">injective</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">ext</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">j</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">compEquiv</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LinearEquiv</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">trans_symm</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LinearEquiv</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">symm_symm</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Basis</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">baseChange_apply</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LinearMap</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">coe_comp</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LinearEquiv</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">coe_coe</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LinearMap</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">coe_inr</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Function</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">comp_apply</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LinearEquiv</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">trans_apply</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Basis</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">repr_symm_apply</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">pderiv_X</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">toComp_val</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">Basis</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">repr_linearCombination</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">LinearMap</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">liftBaseChange_tmul</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">one_smul</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">repr_CotangentSpaceMap</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">  </span><span class=\"k\">obtain</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">j</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">|</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">j</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:=</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">j</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"bp\">&lt;;&gt;</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"n\">simp</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">only</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Basis</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">prod_repr_inr</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Basis</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">baseChange_repr_tmul</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">Basis</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">repr_self</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Basis</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">prod_repr_inl</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">map_zero</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Finsupp</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">coe_zero</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">Pi</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">zero_apply</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ne_eq</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">not_false_eq_true</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Pi</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">single_eq_of_ne</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Pi</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">single_apply</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">Finsupp</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">single_apply</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">ite_smul</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">one_smul</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">zero_smul</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">Sum</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">inr</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">injEq</span><span class=\"o\">,</span>\n<span class=\"w\">      </span><span class=\"n\">MonoidWithZeroHom</span><span class=\"bp\">.</span><span class=\"n\">map_ite_one_zero</span><span class=\"o\">,</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">reduceCtorEq</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">end</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">mathlib_master</span>\n\n<span class=\"kn\">section</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">universe_monomorphism</span>\n\n<span class=\"c\">/-</span><span class=\"cm\">!</span>\n\n<span class=\"cm\">The huge slowdown is, at least partly, caused by universes. See what happens if we put all the types</span>\n<span class=\"cm\">in the same universe, instead of in 5 universes.</span>\n\n<span class=\"cm\">-/</span>\n<span class=\"kn\">variable</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- universe u</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- also universe u</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">CommRing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">CommRing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Algebra</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">(</span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">:</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"kt\">Type</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">u</span><span class=\"o\">)</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"c1\">-- also universe u</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">CommRing</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Algebra</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">R</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span class=\"n\">Algebra</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">S</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">T</span><span class=\"o\">]</span>\n<span class=\"w\">    </span><span class=\"o\">[</span><span 